  <para style="h">Roma</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ikete Pawulo yandikiye ab’i Roma</para>
  <para style="toc2">Roma</para>
  <para style="toc3">Rom</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ikete Pawulo yandikiye ab’i</para>
  <para style="mt1">Roma</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1" />
  <para style="po">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1" />Ndabandikiye jewe Pawulo, umugurano wa Kristo Yesu, nahamagariwe kuba intumwa, ntoranirizwa kuvuga Ubutumwa Bwiza bw’Imana, <verse eid="ROM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2" />ubwo yari yarasezeranye kuva kera ibicishije ku bavugishwa na yo, nk’uko biri mu Vyanditswe Vyera. <verse eid="ROM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3" />Ubwo Butumwa Bwiza bwerekeye Umwana wayo: mu buryo bw’umubiri yakomotse mu ruvyaro rw’umwami Dawidi, <verse eid="ROM 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:4" />maze yerekanwa mu bushobozi ko ari Umwana w’Imana mu buryo bwa Mpwemu Yera, igihe yazuka mu bapfuye. Uwo ni Yesu Kristo Umwami wacu. <verse eid="ROM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5" />Biciye muri Kristo, twagiriwe ubuntu bwo kuba intumwa mu Banyamahanga aho bari hose no kubabwira ivyo Imana yabakoreye, kugira ngo bayizere bongere bayumvire, maze biheshe icubahiro izina ryayo. <verse eid="ROM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6" />Namwe abari i Roma muri bamwe muri abo Banyamahanga bahamagariwe kuba aba Yesu Kristo.<verse eid="ROM 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="po">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7" />Nuko rero ndabandikiye mwebwe ab’i Roma, mukundwa n’Imana kandi mwahamagariwe kuba abantu bayo bejejwe:</para>
  <para style="po" vid="ROM 1:7">Ubuntu n’amahoro biva ku Mana Data wa twese no ku Mwami wacu Yesu Kristo bibe kuri mwebwe mwese.<verse eid="ROM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawulo yipfuza kugendera ab’i Roma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8" />Imbere ya vyose, nagomba gushimira Imana yanje, ndabicishije kuri Yesu Kristo ku bwa mwebwe mwese, kuko ukwizera kwanyu kwamamaye mw’isi yose. <verse eid="ROM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9" />Imana nkorera n’umutima wanje wose mu kuvuga Ubutumwa Bwiza bw’Umwana wayo, ni yo cabona ko ntahengeshanya kubibuka <verse eid="ROM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:10" />igihe cose nsenze. Kimwe mu vyo nsengera, ni uko Imana, nimba bihuye n’ugushaka kwayo, yomfasha kugira ngo nshobore kuza kubaramutsa.<verse eid="ROM 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11" />Nipfuza kubagendera kugira ngo dusangire ingabire ziva kuri Mpwemu, zibakomeze mu Mwami. <verse eid="ROM 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12" />Ico ngomba ni ukubonana namwe kugira ngo ndabatere intege mu kwizera, maze nanje nterwe intege n’ukwizera kwanyu. <verse eid="ROM 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13" />Bene Data, nshaka ko mumenya ko nagerageje kenshi kuza kubaramutsa, ariko ko bitarankundira kugeza n’ubu. Ngomba gukorana namwe kugira ngo ndonke ivyamwa vyo mu buryo bw’impwemu, nk’uko maze kubibona mu bandi Banyamahanga.<verse eid="ROM 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14" />Kuko ntegerezwa kwitaho bose, abantu bose; abateye imbere n’abadateye imbere, abize n’abatize. <verse eid="ROM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15" />Ni co gituma, mfise inyota yo kubabwira Ubutumwa Bwiza namwe ababa i Roma.<verse eid="ROM 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16" />Kuko Jewe Ubutumwa Bwiza ntibuntera isoni. Ni ubushobozi bw’Imana buzanira uwizeye wese agakiza, uhereye ku Muyuda ukageza ku Mugiriki. <verse eid="ROM 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17" />Ubwo Butumwa Bwiza buduhishurira ingene Imana itugira abagororotsi mu maso yayo, kandi ivyo tubihabwa n’ukwizera kwonyene; nk’uko Ivyanditswe Vyera bivuga ngo: “Umugororotsi azobeshwaho n’ukwizera.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="HAB 2:4">Habakuki 2:4</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="ROM 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uburake bw’Imana butewe n’ivyaha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18" />Uburake bw’Imana bwarahishuwe buvuye mw’ijuru, ubwo irakira ukutayubaha kwose n’ububi bw’abantu, kuko mu ngeso zabo mbi bagwanya ukuri ngo ntikugaragare. <verse eid="ROM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19" />Yamara ibikenewe vyose kugira ngo bamenye Imana biragaragara mu maso yabo, kuko Imana ubwayo yabishize ahabona. <verse eid="ROM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20" />Kuva isi iremwa, ivyerekeye Imana bitabonwa n’aya maso: ubushobozi bwayo buhoraho, n’ubumana bwayo, biraboneka neza vyerekanywe n’ivyo yaremye. Ni co gituma ata muntu n’umwe afise ico yokwireguza.<verse eid="ROM 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21" />Ariko naho bamenye Imana, ntibayubashe nk’Imana canke ngo bayishime uko bikwiye, ahubwo ivyiyumviro vyabo vyabandanije kuba bibi, imitima yabo itagira ubwenge yuzura umwijima. <verse eid="ROM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22" />Bavuga ko bafise ubwenge, ariko ni ibipfu. <verse eid="ROM 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23" />Aho gusenga Imana y’icubahiro kandi idapfa, basenga ibishushanyo bibajwe bifise ishuho y’umuntu apfa, iy’inyoni, iy’ibikoko n’iy’ibikwega inda hasi.<verse eid="ROM 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24" />Ivyo vyatumye Imana ibareka kugira ngo bakore ibiteye isoni imitima yabo yipfuza, gutyo bakoreranira ibikorwa bihumanya imibiri yabo. <verse eid="ROM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25" />Ukuri kwerekeye Imana bagukavye ikinyoma, basenga ivyaremwe baranabikorera mu kibanza c’Umuremyi, we abereye gushimwa ibihe vyose! Amen.<verse eid="ROM 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26" />Ivyo ni vyo vyatumye Imana ibaheba ngo bakore ibiteye isoni imitima yabo yipfuza. Mbere n’abagore babo bataye ibanga ry’abubatse nk’uko Imana yaritegekanije, biyononesha gukoresha imibiri yabo mu buryo bunyuranye n’ubwo yaremewe. <verse eid="ROM 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27" />N’abagabo na bo bahevye kuryamana n’abagore babo nk’uko Imana yabitegekanije, biyononesha kwipfuzanya hagati yabo. Abagabo bakoranye n’abandi bagabo ibiteye isoni, hanyuma bahabwa igihano gikwiranye n’ubuzimire bwabo.<verse eid="ROM 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28" />Kuko banse kumenya Imana, na yo yarabahevye irabareka ngo bakurikire ivyiyumviro vyabo bipfuye, bakore ivyo batari babereye gukora. <verse eid="ROM 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29" />Ubuzima bwabo bwuzuyemwo ubukozi bw’ikibi bw’uburyo bwose, ukwipfuza ibintu, urwanko, ishari, ubwicanyi, gutongana, gusukana, guhendana, urusaku, <verse eid="ROM 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30" />kuvuga nabi abandi, kwanka Imana, gutukana, kwibona, kwishira hejuru, ubuhizi mu gukora ikibi, kugarariza abavyeyi, <verse eid="ROM 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31" />guhindagurika, kudashitsa ivyo bemeye, kugira imitima ikomantaye hamwe no kutagira impuhwe. <verse eid="ROM 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32" />Kandi naho bazi ko Imana ihanisha urupfu abakora ivyo, ntibashishikara kubikora gusa, ahubwo bashima n’abandi babikora.<verse eid="ROM 1:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2" />
  <para style="s1">Urubanza rugororotse rw’Imana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1" />None rero, wewe ushobora kwibaza ko wocira imanza abameze batyo, ariko na wewe umeze nka bo nta co wokwireguza. Kuko nimba ucira imanza abandi kandi ukora nk’ivyo bakora, na wewe uba wiciriye urubanza. <verse eid="ROM 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2" />Twese turazi yuko urubanza Imana icira abakora nk’ivyo ari urw’ukuri. <verse eid="ROM 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3" />None wewe ucira imanza abandi, kandi ukora nk’ivyo bakora, wibaza ko uzokira urubanza rw’Imana? <verse eid="ROM 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4" />Canke ntubona ingene Imana igira neza, yihangana kandi idahaniraho? None ivyo nta co bikubwiye? Mbega ntubona ko mu kugira neza kwayo Imana ishaka kugushikana ku kwihana ivyaha vyawe?<verse eid="ROM 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5" />Ariko kubera ufise umutima ukomantaye utagomba kwihana, uriko wikwegera guhanwa, ku musi w’uburake bw’Imana aho urubanza rwayo rugororotse ruzohishurirwa. <verse eid="ROM 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6" />Imana “izoha umuntu wese ingero ikwiranye n’ibikorwa yakoze.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 62:12">Zaburi 62:12</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 24:12">Imigani 24:12</ref></char></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7" />Izoha ubugingo budashira abashishikara gukora ivyiza, bakagira umwete mu kurondera ubwiza, icubahiro no kudapfa bitangwa na yo. <verse eid="ROM 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8" />Ariko izosuka uburake n’ubushangashirwe bwayo kuri abo bose birukira ivyo imitima yabo ihahamiye, batumvira ukuri, bagakurikira ikibi. <verse eid="ROM 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9" />Ivyago n’imibabaro bizoshika ku muntu wese akora ibibi; uhereye ku Muyuda ukageza ku Munyamahanga. <verse eid="ROM 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10" />Ariko abakora ivyiza, bazohabwa ubwiza, icubahiro n’amahoro biva ku Mana; uhereye ku Muyuda ukageza ku Munyamahanga. <verse eid="ROM 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11" />Kuko Imana idahengama ngo igire abo ikunda n’abo yanka.<verse eid="ROM 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12" />Abacumura badafise ivyagezwe vya Mose bazohona ivyo vyagezwe bitarinze kurabwa, kandi abacumura bari musi y’ivyagezwe bazocirwa urubanza n’ivyo vyagezwe. <verse eid="ROM 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13" />Kuko kwumva gusa ivyagezwe ntikutugira abagororotsi mu maso y’Imana, ahubwo kuvyumvira ni kwo kutugira abagororotsi mu maso yayo. <verse eid="ROM 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14" />Abanyamahanga badafise ivyagezwe, iyo bakoze ivyo ivyagezwe bisaba, bamera nk’aho babifise mu mitima yabo, naho batabifise. <verse eid="ROM 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15" />Gutyo baba berekanye ko ivyagezwe vy’Imana vyanditswe mu mitima yabo. Kuko ijwi ryo mu mitima yabo n’ivyiyumviro vyabo bibagiriza iyo bariko barakora ibibi canke bikabahumuriza iyo bariko barakora ivyiza. <verse eid="ROM 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16" />Nuko rero, ubu ni bwo Butumwa Bwiza mvuga: umusi uraje, aho Imana izocira imanza ivyo abantu bagize amabanga yabo, ibicishije kuri Yesu Kristo.<verse eid="ROM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abayuda n’ivyagezwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17" />None kuri wewe bimeze gute? Wiyita Umuyuda, ukishimikiza ivyagezwe vy’Imana, ukishimira ko ufitaniye imigenderanire idasanzwe n’Imana. <verse eid="ROM 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18" />Urazi ivyo Imana ishaka ko ukora, kandi urazi guhitamwo iciza kuko wigishijwe ivyagezwe. <verse eid="ROM 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19" />Wizigira ko uri indongozi y’impumyi, umuco w’abari mu mwijima, <verse eid="ROM 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20" />umwigisha w’abatagira ico bazi, n’umumenyereza w’abakiri bato. Uzi neza ko Ivyagezwe bishobora kuguha kumenya ukuri kwose. <verse eid="ROM 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21" />None, wewe ko wigisha abandi ni kuki utiyigisha nawe? Ko wigisha abandi ngo: Ntimukibe, ni kuki wiba? <verse eid="ROM 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22" />Ko wigisha abantu ngo ntibasambane, ni kuki usambana? Ko uvuga ko wanka ibigirwamana, ni kuki ukoresha ibikoresho vyibwe mu ngoro z’ibigirwamana? <verse eid="ROM 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23" />Wishimira ko ufise ivyagezwe, ariko utukisha Imana mu kutabikurikiza. <verse eid="ROM 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24" />Ni co gituma Ivyanditswe Vyera bivuga ngo: “Ni mwebwe mutukisha izina ry’Imana mu Banyamahanga.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 52:5">Yesaya 52:5</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 36:22">Ezekiyeli 36:22</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="ROM 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25" />Umugenzo w’Abayuda wo gukebwa ufise agaciro mu gihe umuntu yumvira ivyagezwe, ariko igihe atavyumvira nta co aba arushije uwutigeze akebwa. <verse eid="ROM 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26" />Mbega abanyamahanga batigeze bakebwa nibumvira ivyagezwe, ntizobemera nk’ubwoko bwayo naho batigeze bakebwa? <verse eid="ROM 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27" />Mu vy’ukuri, abanyamahanga batakebwe, ariko bagakora ivyo ivyagezwe bivuga, bazotuma mutsindwa n’urubanza mwebwe Abayuda mwakebwe kandi mufise Ivyanditswe ariko ntimuvyumvire.<verse eid="ROM 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28" />Ikigira umuntu Umuyuda w’ukuri si ugukomoka ku bavyeyi b’Abayuda gusa kandi ugukebwa nyakuri si ukwo ku mubiri. <verse eid="ROM 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29" />Ahubwo Umuyuda w’ukuri ni umuntu afise umutima utunganye imbere y’Imana, kandi ugukebwa nyakuri ni ukwo mu mutima. Ico ni igikorwa ca Mpwemu w’Imana, si igikorwa c’Ivyagezwe. Umuntu nk’uwo ashimwa n’Imana aho gushimwa n’abantu.<verse eid="ROM 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3" />
  <para style="s1">Imana ni umwizigirwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1" />Mbega none akamaro ko kwitwa Umuyuda ni akahe? Canke agaciro ko gukebwa ni akahe? <verse eid="ROM 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2" />Mu vy’ukuri bifise ikimazi muri vyinshi. Ubwa mbere, Abayuda ni bo Imana yahaye amajambo yayo.<verse eid="ROM 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3" />Ni ivy’ukuri ko bamwe muri bo batabaye abizigirwa. None ukutizigirwa kwabo kurakuraho ubwizigirwa bw’Imana? <verse eid="ROM 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4" />Haba na mba! Naho abantu bose boba ababeshi, Imana yo iguma ari inyakuri. Ni co gituma Ivyanditswe Vyera bivuga ngo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:4">“Mu vyo uvuga vyose uzokwama uboneka uri umugororotsi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:4">kandi n’imbere y’ubucamanza uzokwama utsinda.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 51:4">Zaburi 51:4</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="ROM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5" />Ariko bamwe bashobora kuvuga bati: Ivyaha vyacu birafise iciza, kuko vyereka abantu ukugororoka kw’Imana. None Imana ibiduhaniye ntiyoba iturenganije? (Iki ni iciyumviro c’abantu.) <verse eid="ROM 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 3:6" />Ntibishoboka ko Imana irenganya! Kuko nimba Imana itagororotse, yoshobora ite gucira imanza isi yose? <verse eid="ROM 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7" />Vyoshoboka ko hari abaciyumvira bati: “None nimba ububi bwanje burushiriza kwerekana ko Imana ari inyakuri kandi bikayihesha icubahiro, ni kuki yoncira urubanza nk’umunyavyaha?” <verse eid="ROM 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8" />Mbere hariho n’abatubeshera ngo tuvuga ko dukwiye gucumura cane, kugira ngo havemwo ivyiza! Abavuga ivyo bazocirwa urubanza rubakwiye.<verse eid="ROM 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nta n’umwe agororotse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9" />None tuvuge ko twebwe Abayuda twoba turi beza kurusha Abanyamahanga? Haba na mba! Kuko twamaze kwerekana ko abantu bose, baba Abayuda canke Abanyamahanga, bari musi y’ububasha bw’icaha, <verse eid="ROM 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10" />nk’uko handitswe ngo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:10">“Nta muntu agororotse, nta n’umwe;<verse eid="ROM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11" />nta n’umwe atahura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:11">kandi nta n’umwe arondera Imana.<verse eid="ROM 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12" />Bose barazimiye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:12">maze bacika imburakimazi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:12">nta n’umwe akora iciza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:12">nta n’umwe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 14:1-3">Zaburi 14:1-3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 53:1-3">53:1-3</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 7:20">Umusiguzi 7:20</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="ROM 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13" />Imihogo yabo imeze nk’imva zirangaye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:13">indimi zabo zivuga ibinyoma gusa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 5:9">Zaburi 5:9</ref></char></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:13">Ubumara bw’inzoka buri ku minwa yabo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 140:3">Zaburi 140:3</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="ROM 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14" />Akanwa kabo kuzuye imivumo n’umururazi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 10:7">Zaburi 10:7</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="ROM 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15" />Ibirenge vyabo vyirukira kuvisha amaraso;<verse eid="ROM 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16" />aho baciye bahasiga imisaka n’ubworo,<verse eid="ROM 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17" />kandi ntibigeze bamenya inzira z’amahoro.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 59:7">Yesaya 59:7</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 59:8">8</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="ROM 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18" />Nta gutinya Imana kuri muri bo.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 36:1">Zaburi 36:1</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="ROM 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19" />Noneho turazi ko ivyo ivyagezwe vyigisha biraba abaganzwa na vyo, kugira ngo ntihagire uwuronka ico yireguza kandi isi yose iboneke ko ikwiye gutsindwa n’urubanza rw’Imana. <verse eid="ROM 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20" />Ni co gituma ata muntu n’umwe azokwemerwa n’Imana ko agororotse, abihawe no kwubahiriza ivyagezwe. Igikorwa c’ivyagezwe ni ukutwerekana ko turi abanyavyaha.<verse eid="ROM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukugororoka kuzanwa n’ukwizera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21" />Ariko noneho, Imana yaraduhishuriye ingene dushobora kuronka ukugororoka kwayo tutisunze ivyagezwe, nk’uko Mose n’abavugishwa n’Imana babishingiye intahe mu gihe ca kera. <verse eid="ROM 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22" />Ukwizera Yesu Kristo ni kwo kwonyene gutuma twemerwa n’Imana ko tugororotse imbere yayo. Kandi ivyo Imana ibikorera uwizera Yesu Kristo wese, ata we ikumiriye. <verse eid="ROM 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:23" />Kuko abantu bose baracumuye, bituma badashikira ubwiza bw’Imana. <verse eid="ROM 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24" />Ariko Imana, mu buntu bwayo, itwemera ko tugororotse mu maso yayo biciye mu gucungurwa turonkera muri Kristo Yesu. <verse eid="ROM 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25" />Imana yamutanze kugira ngo abe ikimazi, atange amaraso yiwe abe impongano y’ivyaha vy’uwo wese yemeye kumwizera. Imana yabikoze gutyo kugira ngo yerekane ukugororoka kwayo, kuko yihanganiye abantu ntiyabahanira ibigabitanyo bakoze muri kahise. <verse eid="ROM 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:26" />Ivyo yabikoze kugira ngo yerekane ukugororoka kwayo muri iki gihe; kandi ubwo bugororotsi bwayo nyene irongera ikabwerekana mu gufata abanyavyaha bizeye Yesu Kristo ko babaye abagororotsi.<verse eid="ROM 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27" />None twokwirata iki? Nta na kimwe! Kuko ukwemerwa n’Imana kwacu ntikuva ku kwubahiriza ivyagezwe, ariko kuva ku kwizera. <verse eid="ROM 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28" />Ng’ibi rero ivyo tuvuga: umuntu yemerwa nk’umugororotsi imbere y’Imana biciye mu kwizera gusa, ntibiva ku kwubahiriza ivyagezwe. <verse eid="ROM 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29" />Mbega, Imana ni iy’Abayuda gusa? Si n’iy’Abanyamahanga na bo? Egome, ni iy’Abanyamahanga na bo nyene. <verse eid="ROM 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30" />Hari Imana imwe gusa, kandi yemera abantu ko bagororotse biciye mu kwizera, baba Abayuda canke Abanyamahanga. <verse eid="ROM 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31" />None dushimikiye cane ku kwizera, tuba dushaka kwirengagiza ivyagezwe? Haba na mba! Ahubwo iyo twizeye tuba twemeje yuko ivyagezwe bivuga ukuri.<verse eid="ROM 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4" />
  <para style="s1">Dufatire akarorero kuri Aburahamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1" />Mbega none twovuga iki kuri Aburahamu sogokuruza? Yatahuye iki ku vyerekeye ingene umuntu yemerwa n’Imana nk’umugororotsi? <verse eid="ROM 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2" />Iyo Aburahamu yemerwa n’Imana nk’umugororotsi kubera ibikorwa vyiza yakoze, yari kuba afise ico yirata. Ariko imbere y’Imana si ko vyagenze. <verse eid="ROM 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3" />Ivyanditswe Vyera bivuga iki? Bivuga ko, “Aburahamu yizeye Imana, hanyuma ukwo kwizera kwiwe gutuma Imana imwemera nk’umugororotsi.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">Itanguriro 15:6</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="ROM 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4" />Iyo umuntu akoze igikorwa, impembo bamuhemba ntiba ari ingabire, aba aronse ikintu yakoreye ategerezwa guhabwa. <verse eid="ROM 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5" />Ariko Imana ntiyemera abantu ko bagororotse, kubera ibikorwa vyabo, ibemera kubera bayizeye yo iharira abanyavyaha. <verse eid="ROM 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6" />Ivyo ni vyo Dawidi yavuga yerekana amahirwe y’umuntu yemewe n’Imana nk’umugororotsi, itaravye ibikorwa yakoze:<verse eid="ROM 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7" />“Hahiriwe umuntu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 4:7">Imana yababariye ibikorwa vyiwe bibi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 4:7">ivyaha vyiwe bigaharirwa.<verse eid="ROM 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8" />Hahiriwe umuntu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 4:8">Uhoraho adaharurako ivyaha vyiwe.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 32:1">Zaburi 32:1</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 32:2">2</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="ROM 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9" />None, ayo mahirwe Dawidi avuga ni ay’Abayuda gusa? Oya, na mba! Ni n’ay’Abanyamahanga na bo nyene. Kuko, twamaze kuvuga ko Aburahamu yizeye Imana, maze ukwo kwizera kwiwe gutuma Imana imwemera nk’umugororotsi. <verse eid="ROM 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10" />Mbega none ivyo vyabaye ryari? Imana yoba yamwemeye nk’umugororotsi amaze gukebwa canke atarakebwa? Mu vy’ukuri, Imana yamwemeye nk’umugororotsi atarakebwa! <verse eid="ROM 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11" />Yakebwe mu nyuma, kandi ukwo gukebwa kwiwe cari ikimenyetso cerekana ko kubera ukwizera kwiwe, Imana yari yaramaze kumwemera nk’uwugororotse imbere yuko akebwa. Gutyo, mu buryo bw’impwemu Aburahamu ni we sekuruza w’abizera bose naho boba batakebwe, kandi Imana irabemera ko bagororotse, kubera ukwizera kwabo. <verse eid="ROM 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12" />Kandi mu buryo bw’impwemu, Aburahamu ni sekuruza w’abo bose bakebwe, ariko ni mu gihe bafise ukwizera nk’ukwo yari afise imbere y’uko akebwa.<verse eid="ROM 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13" />Mu vy’ukuri, Imana ntiyahaye Aburahamu n’abazomukomokako bose isezerano ryo kuragwa isi kubera kwumvira ivyagezwe, ahubwo yarimuhaye kubera yayizeye, maze na yo ica imwemera nk’umugororotsi mu maso yayo. <verse eid="ROM 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14" />Nimba isezerano ari iry’abumvira ivyagezwe gusa, rero ukwizera nta co kumaze kandi n’isezerano ry’Imana nta gaciro rifise. <verse eid="ROM 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15" />Ivyagezwe bizana uburake bw’Imana ku wubirengako wese, kandi iyo bitahari ntihaba kubirengako.<verse eid="ROM 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16" />Nuko rero, isezerano ryatanzwe kubera ukwizera kugira ngo bigaragare ko ari ingabire Imana itanga ku buntu, kandi ko rigenewe abakomoka kuri Aburahamu bose, baba abubahiriza ivyagezwe canke abizera nk’uko yizera, kuko Aburahamu ari we sekuruza w’abizera bose. <verse eid="ROM 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17" />Ivyo ni vyo Ivyanditswe Vyera vyavuga igihe Imana yavuga ngo: “Nakugize sekuruza w’amahanga menshi.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 17:5">Itanguriro 17:5</ref></char></char></note> Ivyo rero vyabaye kuko Aburahamu yizeye Imana ishobora kuzura n’uwapfuye, ikarema n’ibintu bishasha ibikuye mu busa.<verse eid="ROM 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18" />Mbere no mu gihe vyaboneka ko ata vyizigiro bikiriho, Aburahamu we yabandanije yizera, gutyo aba sekuruza w’amahanga menshi kuko Imana yari yavuze iti: “Uko ni ko abagukomokako bazongana.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 15:5">Itanguriro 15:5</ref></char></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19" />Ico gihe yari afise hafi imyaka ijana, ariko ukwizera kwiwe ntikwigeze kugabanuka, naho umubiri wiwe wari umaze kuba akaheze, kandi na Sara akaba yasa n’utagishobora kuvyara. <verse eid="ROM 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20" />Aburahamu ntiyigeze anyiganyiga mu kwizera isezerano ry’Imana, ahubwo ukwizera kwiwe kwagumye gukomera, kandi ivyo vyahesheje Imana icubahiro. <verse eid="ROM 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21" />Yari azi ko Imana ishoboye gushitsa ico yasezeranye. <verse eid="ROM 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22" />Ukwo kwizera kwiwe kwatumye Imana imwemera nk’umugororotsi. <verse eid="ROM 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:23" />Aya majambo avuga ngo: “Imana imwemera nk’umugororotsi,” ntiyanditswe ku bwiwe wenyene, <verse eid="ROM 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24" />ahubwo natwe ni ayacu kuko twizeye uwazuye Umwami wacu Yesu amukuye mu bapfuye. <verse eid="ROM 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25" />Uwo, Imana yaramutanze ngo apfe azira ivyaha vyacu hanyuma imuzura mu bapfuye kugira ngo atume twemerwa na yo nk’abagororotsi.<verse eid="ROM 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5" />
  <para style="s1">Amahoro n’ivyizigiro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1" />Ni co gituma, kuva twemewe nk’abagororotsi imbere y’Imana biciye mu kwizera, dufitaniye amahoro na yo kubera igikorwa Yesu Kristo Umwami wacu yadukoreye. <verse eid="ROM 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2" />Tumaze kumwizera; Kristo yadushikanye muri ubu buntu turimwo, kandi dufise umunezero no kwizigira ko tuzosangira na we ubwiza bw’Imana. <verse eid="ROM 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3" />Ikigeretseko, n’iyo duciye mu mibabaro, turanezerwa kuko tuzi yuko ivyo bituma tumenyerezwa kwihangana. <verse eid="ROM 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4" />Ukwo kwihangana gutuma tugwiza inkomezi zo mu mutima, izo na zo zikaduha kugumana ivyizigiro. <verse eid="ROM 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5" />Kandi, ivyo vyizigiro ntibitetereza, kuko Imana yasutse urukundo rwayo mu mitima yacu ibicishije muri Mpwemu Yera yaduhaye.<verse eid="ROM 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6" />Igihe twari tukiri abanyantegenke, Kristo yaraje, aza mu gihe gikwiye Imana yashinze, maze aradupfira twebwe abanyavyaha. <verse eid="ROM 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7" />Gupfira umugororotsi bisanzwe bigoye; naho womenga birumvikana ko hatobura uwemera gupfira umuntu w’intungane. <verse eid="ROM 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8" />Ariko, Imana yo yatweretse urukundo rwayo rwinshi mu gutuma Kristo kudupfira kandi tukiri abanyavyaha.<verse eid="ROM 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9" />Ikindi, ko twemewe n’Imana nk’abagororotsi kubera amaraso ya Kristo, nta nkeka ko n’uburake bw’Imana na bwo azobudukiza. <verse eid="ROM 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10" />Kuko nimba Imana yaduhaye kwuzura na yo biciye mu rupfu rw’Umwana wayo tukiri abansi bayo, ntidukekeranya ko, ubu tumaze kwuzura na yo, tuzokizwa n’ubugingo bwiwe. <verse eid="ROM 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11" />Kandi si ivyo vyonyene, ubu dufise umunezero kubera imigenderanire myiza dufitaniye n’Imana kuko Umwami wacu Yesu Kristo yatwujuje na yo.<verse eid="ROM 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Urupfu rwazanywe na Adamu, ubugingo buzanwa na Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12" />Icaha cinjiye mw’isi giciye ku muntu umwe ari we Adamu, kandi ico caha cazanye urupfu. Ivyo vyatumye urupfu rushika ku bantu bose, kuko bose bacumuye.<verse eid="ROM 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13" />Mu vy’ukuri, n’imbere y’uko Imana iha Mose Ivyagezwe, icaha cari mw’isi. Ariko Imana nta n’umwe yacagiriza kuko ata vyagezwe vyari bwatangwe. <verse eid="ROM 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14" />Yamara kuva mu gihe ca Adamu gushika mu gihe ca Mose, abantu bagumye bapfa, mbere n’abatarenze ku cagezwe bahawe n’Imana nk’uko Adamu yakirenzeko, barapfuye. Uwo Adamu yari ishusho ya Kristo, uwari agiye kuzoza.<verse eid="ROM 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15" />Ariko hariho itandukaniro rinini hagati y’igicumuro ca Adamu n’ingabire y’ubuntu bw’Imana. Ni ivy’ukuri ko abantu benshi bapfuye kubera igicumuro c’uwo muntu umwe. Yamara ubuntu bw’Imana n’ingabire y’imbabazi yatanze biciye ku wundi muntu, ari we Yesu Kristo, birengeye cane ivyo. <verse eid="ROM 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16" />Ibiva mu ngabire y’ubuntu bw’Imana biratandukanye cane n’ivyavuye mu gicumuro c’umuntu umwe kuko inyuma y’icaha ca Adamu hakurikiye gutsindwa n’urubanza, ariko ingabire y’ubuntu bw’Imana yatumye twemerwa na yo naho dufise ivyaha vyinshi bitwagira. <verse eid="ROM 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:17" />Ni ivy’ukuri ko kubera igicumuro c’umuntu umwe, urupfu rwashitse ku bantu bose. Ariko, biciye ku wundi muntu umwe nyene, ari we Yesu Kristo, Imana yahaye abana b’abantu ivyiza birengeje: yabagiriye ubuntu butagira akagero ibemera ko bagororotse kandi yemera ko bazoganzanya na Kristo.<verse eid="ROM 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18" />Ni ukuri, nk’uko igicumuro c’umuntu umwe, ari we Adamu, cazaniye abantu bose gutsindwa n’urubanza, ni ko n’igikorwa kimwe co kugororoka ca Yesu cazaniye abantu bose kwemerwa n’Imana nk’abagororotsi no kuronka ubugingo. <verse eid="ROM 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19" />Nk’uko umuntu umwe yanse kwumvira Imana bigatuma abantu benshi bahinduka abanyavyaha, ni ko no kwumvira Imana kw’uwundi muntu umwe nyene, kuzotuma benshi bahinduka abagororotsi.<verse eid="ROM 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20" />Ivyagezwe vyatanzwe kugira ngo ibicumuro bigwire. Ariko uko abantu barushirije gukora ivyaha, ni ko n’ubuntu bw’Imana butangaje bwarushirije kugwira. <verse eid="ROM 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21" />Rero, nk’uko icaha caganje abantu bose kikabashikana ku rupfu, ni ko n’ubuntu bw’Imana butangaje bwashitse ku bantu bose bukabaha kwemerwa n’Imana nk’abagororotsi, maze bigatuma bagira ubugingo budashira bubonerwa muri Yesu Kristo Umwami wacu.<verse eid="ROM 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6" />
  <para style="s1">Gupfa ku caha tukabaho muri Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1" />Mbega none tuvuge iki? Dushishikare gukora ivyaha kugira ngo ubuntu bw’Imana bwongerekane? <verse eid="ROM 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2" />Ntibikabe! Abapfuye ku caha twoba tukikibamwo dute? <verse eid="ROM 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:3" />Mbega ntimuzi yuko twebwe ababatirijwe kuba umwe na Kristo Yesu, twafatanijwe na we no mu rupfu rwiwe? <verse eid="ROM 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4" />Ivyo bivuga ko twapfuye hanyuma tugahambanwa na we mu kubatizwa, kugira ngo, nk’uko yazuwe mu bapfuye n’ubushobozi bw’ubwiza bwa Data, abe ari ko natwe tubaho mu bugingo bushasha.<verse eid="ROM 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5" />Kandi nimba twagizwe umwe na Kristo mu rupfu rwiwe, natwe tuzozurwa nk’uko na we yazuwe. <verse eid="ROM 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6" />Turazi neza ko kamere muntu ka kera, gakunda icaha kabambanywe na Kristo, kugira ngo inkomezi z’icaha zishire mu mibiri yacu, ntituze dusubire kuba abagurano b’icaha. <verse eid="ROM 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7" />Kuko iyo umuntu apfuye aba atandukanye no gukora ivyaha.<verse eid="ROM 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8" />Nimba rero twarapfanye na Kristo, twizera ko tuzobana na we kandi turi muri we. <verse eid="ROM 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9" />Turabizi neza ko Kristo yazutse mu bapfuye, kandi ntazosubira gupfa. Urupfu nta bubasha rukimufiseko. <verse eid="ROM 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10" />Igihe yapfa, yapfuye rimwe rizima kugira ngo amare icaha ubushobozi. Ariko noneho ko ariho, ariho kugira ngo aheshe icubahiro Imana.<verse eid="ROM 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11" />None rero, namwe nimufate ko mwapfuye, ko icaha kitakibafiseko ubushobozi, kandi ko muriho muri ab’Imana muri Kristo Yesu. <verse eid="ROM 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12" />Icaha ntikikaganze mu mibiri yanyu izopfa umusi umwe, kandi ntimukumvire ivyipfuzo bibi vy’imibiri yanyu. <verse eid="ROM 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13" />Ntihakagire urugingo na rumwe rw’umubiri wanyu ruheberwa icaha, ngo rube igikoresho c’ibibi. Ahubwo, mwihe Imana rwose, nk’abazutse bavuye mu bapfuye. Imibiri yanyu muyihindure ibikoresho vyo kugororoka ku bw’icubahiro c’Imana. <verse eid="ROM 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14" />Icaha ntikikabaganze kuko ntimukirongorwa n’ivyagezwe, ahubwo muri musi y’ubuntu bw’Imana.<verse eid="ROM 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abagurano bo kugororoka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15" />None, ko ubuntu bw’Imana bwatubohoye tukaba tutakiganzwa n’ivyagezwe, bisigura ko dushobora kubandanya dukora ivyaha? Ntibikabe! <verse eid="ROM 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16" />Mbega ntimuzi ko iyo umuntu yahisemwo kuganzwa n’ikintu ahinduka umugurano waco? Umuntu ashobora kuba umugurano w’icaha, bikamushikana ku rupfu, canke agahitamwo kwumvira Imana, bikamushoboza kubaho ubuzima bugororotse. <verse eid="ROM 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17" />Ariko, Imana ishimwe, kuko naho mwigeze kuba abagurano b’icaha, ubu mwarumviye n’imitima yanyu yose ukuri kuri mu nyigisho mwakiriye. <verse eid="ROM 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:18" />Ubu mwarabohowe ntimukiri abagurano b’icaha, ahubwo mwahindutse abagurano bo kugororoka.<verse eid="ROM 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19" />Kubera intege nke za kamere muntu mufise, ndiko nkoresha imvugo isanzwe, kugira ngo mushobore kuvyumva. Kera mwari mwaratanze imibiri yanyu ngo ibe ibikoresho vy’ibiterasoni n’umugararizo, kandi ivyo vyatuma murushiriza kuba abagarariji. None rero nimwitange kugira ngo muhinduke abagurano bo kugororoka, maze mushobore kuba abera. <verse eid="ROM 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20" />Igihe mwari abagurano b’icaha, mwari mufise umwidegemvyo wo gukora ibitagororotse. <verse eid="ROM 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21" />Mbega none igihe mwabikora mwungutse iki, ko n’ubu mubiraba mukamaramara? Kandi ivyo bintu amaherezo yavyo ni urupfu. <verse eid="ROM 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22" />Ubu rero ko mwabohotse mutakiganzwa n’icaha, mwahindutse abagurano b’Imana, inyungu yanyu ni ubuzima bwiyeguriye Imana, kandi ivyo bibashikana ku bugingo budashira. <verse eid="ROM 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23" />Kuko impembo y’icaha ni urupfu, ariko ingabire Imana itanga ku buntu ni ubugingo budashira duheshwa no kwizera Kristo Yesu, Umwami wacu.<verse eid="ROM 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7" />
  <para style="s1">Kubohoka ku vyagezwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1" />Mbega bene Data, ko mwebwe muzi ivy’amategeko, ntimuzi yuko amategeko agenga umuntu akiri muzima? <verse eid="ROM 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2" />Nk’akarorero, umugore yubatse, amategeko amufatanya n’umugabo wiwe mu gihe cose uwo mugabo akiriho, ariko uwo mugabo apfuye, ayo mategeko ntaba akimumuboheyeko. <verse eid="ROM 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3" />Bishitse akarongorwa n’uwundi mugabo kandi uwa mbere akiriho, bamwita umusambanyikazi. Ariko iyo umugabo wiwe wa mbere apfuye, amategeko ntaba akimubuza kurongorwa n’uwundi mugabo, kandi iyo abikoze ntaba asambanye.<verse eid="ROM 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4" />Ni ko biri no kuri mwebwe, bene Data: ku bijanye n’ivyagezwe, namwe mwarapfuye, ntimukiganzwa na vyo, kuko mugize umubiri wa Kristo. Ubu rero muri ab’uwo yazutse mu bapfuye kugira ngo twamire Imana ivyamwa vyiza. <verse eid="ROM 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5" />Igihe twari tukiganjwe na kamere muntu kacu ka kera, ivyipfuzo vy’ivyaha vyishimikiza ivyagezwe bigakorera mu mibiri yacu, kandi ivyo twakora vyose vyadushikana ku rupfu. <verse eid="ROM 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6" />Ubu ivyagezwe ntibikituboshe, kuko twapfuye kuri vyo bikaba bitakituganza. Ni co gituma dushobora gukorera Imana, atari muri bwa buryo bwa kera bwo kwumvira ivyagezwe vyanditse, ariko mu buryo bushasha bwo kuba muri Mpwemu.<verse eid="ROM 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kugwana n’icaha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7" />Mbega none tuvuge iki? Tuvuge ko ivyagezwe ari icaha? Haba na mba! Ahubwo ivyagezwe vyatumye menya icaha canje. Mu vy’ukuri sinari kwigera menya ico ari co kwipfuza, iyo ivyagezwe bitaba bivuga ngo: “Ntukipfuze.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 20:17">Kuvayo 20:17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:21">Gusubiramwo 5:21</ref></char></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8" />Kuva ubwo, icaha caciye kironka akaryo ko gukangura muri jewe ivyipfuzo bibi vy’uburyo bwose! Iyo ivyagezwe bitaba biriho, icaha nticari kugira ubushobozi. <verse eid="ROM 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9" />Kera ivyagezwe bitaraza nari muzima. Hanyuma menye ico amabwirizwa avuga, icaha gica kiba kizima nanje ndapfa. <verse eid="ROM 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10" />Maze nsanga ibwirizwa ryo mu vyagezwe, ryonshikanye ku bugingo, ahubwo rinzaniye urupfu rwo mu buryo bw’impwemu. <verse eid="ROM 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11" />Icaha rero gica kironka akaryo ko kunsuka gihawe n’iryo bwirizwa, kandi gikoresheje iryo bwirizwa nyene gica kiranyica. <verse eid="ROM 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12" />Ariko naho biri uko, ivyagezwe biratunganye, kandi n’amabwirizwa yavyo aratunganye, aragororotse kandi ni meza.<verse eid="ROM 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13" />None ivyo bishoboka gute? Mbega ikintu ciza conzanira urupfu? Haba na mba! Icaha cakoresheje ikintu ciza mu ntumbero yo kunyica. Ivyo vyerekana ingene icaha ari kibi, kuko gikoresha n’amabwirizwa meza y’Imana mu gukora ikibi.<verse eid="ROM 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14" />Ivyagezwe ubwavyo ni ivy’impwemu, ariko jewe ndi umuntu w’umunyantegenke ajakariye icaha. <verse eid="ROM 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15" />Nanje ubwanje sinitahura, kuko ivyo nipfuza gukora si vyo nkora, ahubwo nsanga nakoze ivyo nanka. <verse eid="ROM 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16" />None rero iyo menye ko ivyo nkoze ntashaka gukora ari bibi, mba nemeje ko ivyagezwe ari vyiza. <verse eid="ROM 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17" />Kandi ko nkora ivyo ntashaka, vyerekana ko atari jewe ndabikora, ariko ko ari icaha kiba muri jewe. <verse eid="ROM 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18" />Ndazi neza ko, muri kamere kanje k’icaha ata ciza kimbamwo, kuko naho nipfuza gukora ibigororotse, sindabishobora. <verse eid="ROM 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19" />Mu vy’ukuri, ivyiza ngomba gukora si vyo nkora, ahubwo ibibi ntagomba gukora nsanga ari vyo nakoze. <verse eid="ROM 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20" />Iyo nkoze ivyo ntagomba, bisigura ko atari jewe ndabikora, ariko ko ari icaha kiba muri jewe kibinkoresha.<verse eid="ROM 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21" />Nasanze hari icagezwe kimbamwo: iyo ngomba gukora ivyiza, nsanga nakoze ibibi. <verse eid="ROM 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22" />Ndakunda ivyagezwe vy’Imana n’umutima wanje wose. <verse eid="ROM 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23" />Ariko, hariho ikindi cagezwe kigwanya ico umutima wanje wemera. Ico na co, kingira imbohe y’icagezwe c’icaha gikorera mu mubiri wanje. <verse eid="ROM 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24" />Ewe jewe ndagowe! Ni nde azombohora uwu mubiri unjana mu rupfu? <verse eid="ROM 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:25" />Imana ishimwe yo imbohora biciye muri Yesu Kristo Umwami wacu!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 7:25">Nuko rero, mu mutima wanje nipfuza cane kwumvira ivyagezwe vy’Imana, ariko muri kamere muntu kanje njakariye icagezwe c’icaha.<verse eid="ROM 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8" />
  <para style="s1">Ubuzima buronkerwa muri Mpwemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1" />Ubu rero, abari muri Kristo Yesu nta rubanza rukibatsinda. <verse eid="ROM 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2" />Kuko icagezwe ca Mpwemu atanga ubugingo carambohoye biciye muri Kristo Yesu, kinkurako icagezwe c’icaha n’ic’urupfu. <verse eid="ROM 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3" />Ivyagezwe vya Mose ntivyashobora gukora ivyo, kubera intege nke za kamere kacu k’icaha. Ico ivyagezwe bitashoboye gukora, Imana yagikoze mu gutuma Umwana wayo, yaje afise umubiri nk’uw’umunyavyaha kugira ngo abe ikimazi c’ivyaha. Kandi muri uwo mubiri, Imana irangiza ububasha icaha cari kidufiseko mu kuwutanga nk’ikimazi c’ivyaha vyacu; gutyo icira urubanza icaha mu mubiri. <verse eid="ROM 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4" />Ivyo yabikoze kugira ngo dushobore gushitsa ivyo ivyagezwe bisaba, kuko tutakirongorwa na kamere kacu k’icaha, ariko turongorwa na Mpwemu.<verse eid="ROM 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5" />Abarongorwa na kamere kabo k’icaha bashira imitima ku vyipfuzo vy’umubiri, ariko abarongorwa na Mpwemu Yera, bashira imitima ku vyo Mpwemu agomba. <verse eid="ROM 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6" />Kurongorwa na kamere k’icaha bijana mu rupfu. Ariko kurongorwa na Mpwemu bishikana ku bugingo n’amahoro. <verse eid="ROM 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7" />Kuko abaganzwa na kamere k’icaha ni abansi b’Imana. Ntibumvira ivyagezwe vyayo, kandi nta bushobozi bafise bwo kuvyumvira. <verse eid="ROM 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8" />Ni co gituma abarongorwa na kamere kabo k’icaha badashobora guhimbara Imana na gatoya.<verse eid="ROM 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9" />Ariko mweho, ntimurongorwa na kamere k’icaha, murongorwa na Mpwemu, nimba Mpwemu w’Imana aba muri mwebwe. Kandi umuntu wese adafise Mpwemu wa Kristo, si uwa Kristo. <verse eid="ROM 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10" />Ariko nimba Kristo aba muri mwebwe, naho imibiri yanyu izopfa kubera icaha, Mpwemu ni we abaha ubugingo kuko mwemewe n’Imana nk’abagororotsi. <verse eid="ROM 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11" />Nimba Mpwemu w’Imana yazuye Kristo mu bapfuye aba muri mwebwe, nta kabuza ko Imana izoha imibiri yanyu ipfa ubugingo, biciye muri Mpwemu wayo aba muri mwebwe.<verse eid="ROM 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12" />Kubera ivyo rero bene Data, ntidutegerezwa gukora ivyo kamere kacu k’icaha kadutegeka gukora. <verse eid="ROM 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13" />Kuko nimba murongorwa na kamere kanyu k’icaha muzopfa, ariko nimba Mpwemu yarabashoboje kwica ibikorwa bibi vya kamere muntu kanyu ka kera, muzobaho.<verse eid="ROM 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14" />Abarongorwa na Mpwemu w’Imana bose ni bo bana b’Imana; <verse eid="ROM 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15" />kuko Mpwemu mwahawe atari uwo kubagira abagurano ngo mwongere gutinya; ahubwo mwakiriye Mpwemu abagira abana b’Imana. Uwo ni we atuma dusemerera, tukabwira Imana tuti: <char style="tl">“Aba,</char> Data.” <verse eid="ROM 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16" />Kuko Mpwemu ubwiwe avugana n’impwemu yacu akatwemeza ko turi abana b’Imana. <verse eid="ROM 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17" />Kandi ko turi abana, turi n’abaragwa: turi abaragwa b’Imana, abaraganwa na Kristo. Ariko nimba dushaka gusangira na we ubwiza bwiwe, dutegerezwa gusangira n’umubabaro wiwe na wo.<verse eid="ROM 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubwiza tubikiwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18" />Niyumvira ko imibabaro turimwo ata ho ihuriye na gatoya n’ubwiza tuzohishurirwa, <verse eid="ROM 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19" />kandi ivyaremwe vyose birindiranye igishika igihe Imana izohishura abana bayo. <verse eid="ROM 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20" />Kuko ivyaremwe vyose vyisanze musi y’umuvumo w’Imana, naho bitabihisemwo. Ariko bifise ivyizigiro <verse eid="ROM 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:21" />ko na vyo nyene bizobohorwa bikava mu buja bwo kubora, bigahabwa ku bwiza n’umwidegemvyo vy’abana b’Imana.<verse eid="ROM 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22" />Kugeza n’ubu ivyaremwe vyose binihishwa n’umubabaro nk’umuvyeyi ari ku bise. <verse eid="ROM 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23" />Ariko si vyo vyonyene biniha; natwe abizera, naho dufise Mpwemu Yera muri twebwe nk’ivyeze ubwa mbere vy’ubwiza tuzohabwa, turaniha mu mitima yacu kuko turindiranye igishika kugirwa abana b’Imana bwegu, ari kwo gucungurwa kw’imibiri yacu. <verse eid="ROM 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24" />Ivyo ni vyo twiteze kuva dukijijwe. Iyo icari citezwe kibonetse, kucitega kuba kurangiye. None hari umuntu yokwitega ico yamaze kubona? <verse eid="ROM 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25" />Ariko ko twiteze ivyo tutarabona, dutegerezwa kubirindira twihanganye.<verse eid="ROM 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26" />Muri uko kurindira, Mpwemu Yera ni we adufasha mu ntege nke zacu. Mu vy’ukuri ntituzi ico dukwiye gusengera, ariko Mpwemu Yera aradusengera aniha iminiho idashobora gusigurwa n’amajambo. <verse eid="ROM 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27" />Kandi Imana isuzuma imitima, iramenya neza ico Mpwemu yiyumvira, kuko Mpwemu adusengera twebwe abejejwe nk’uko Imana igomba.<verse eid="ROM 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28" />Turazi ko muri vyose Imana ikora ishakira ineza abayikunda, abo yahamagaye nk’uko biri mu mugambi wayo. <verse eid="ROM 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29" />Kuko Imana yabamenye kera, ibatoraniriza gusa n’Umwana wayo imbere y’igihe, kugira ngo abe imfura muri bene Se benshi. <verse eid="ROM 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30" />Abo yatoranije kera, yarabahamagaye; abo yahamagaye, yabahinduye abagororotsi; abo yahinduye abagororotsi, yabahaye ubwiza.<verse eid="ROM 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubwinshi bw’urukundo rw’Imana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31" />Mbega none tuvuge iki? Nimba Imana iri mu ruhande rwacu, ni nde yodutsinda? <verse eid="ROM 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32" />Ko itimanye Umwana wayo bwite, ariko ikamutanga ku bwacu twese, mbega ntizorushiriza kutugabira vyose hamwe na we? <verse eid="ROM 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33" />Ni nde azorega abo Imana yatoranije? Nta n’umwe, kuko Imana ni yo ibahindura abagororotsi. <verse eid="ROM 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34" />None ni nde azobatsindisha? Nta n’umwe, kuko Kristo Yesu yadupfiriye, ikigeretseko yarazutse ku bwacu, ubu yicaye mu kibanza c’iteka i buryo bw’Imana kandi aradusengera. <verse eid="ROM 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35" />Ni nde yodutandukanya n’urukundo rwa Kristo? Mbega ni ivyago, canke ni imibabaro, canke ni uguhamwa, canke ni inzara, canke ni ubukene, canke ni kuba mw’irinde, canke ni urupfu? <verse eid="ROM 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36" />Nk’uko Ivyanditswe Vyera bivuga ngo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 8:36">“Kubera wewe, twama tugeramiwe n’urupfu umwanya wose;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 8:36">dufatwa nk’intama zijanywe kubagwa.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 44:22">Zaburi 44:22</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="ROM 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37" />Ariko naho bimeze uko, dufise intsinzi yuzuye ku bwa Kristo yadukunze. <verse eid="ROM 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38" />Kandi ndizera neza ntakekeranya ko ata kintu na kimwe codutandukanya n’urukundo rw’Imana. Nta rupfu canke ubugingo, nta bamarayika canke abatware, nta biriho canke ibizoza, nta bushobozi na bumwe, <verse eid="ROM 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:39" />bwaba ubwo mw’ijuru canke ubwo kw’isi, nta na kimwe mu vyaremwe vyose codutandukanya n’urukundo rw’Imana rwahishuriwe muri Kristo Yesu, Umwami wacu.<verse eid="ROM 8:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9" />
  <para style="s1">Pawulo yumvira umubabaro Abisirayeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1" />Mvuga ukuri kuko ndi uwa Kristo simbesha; ijwi ryo mu mutima wanje na Mpwemu Yera biranshingira intahe: <verse eid="ROM 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 9:2" />umutima wanje wuzuye intuntu n’umubabaro udahera <verse eid="ROM 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:3" />ku bwa benewacu b’Abayuda. Nopfuma mba ikivume ngatandukana na Kristo, nimba ivyo vyotuma abo mu bwoko bwanje bakizwa. <verse eid="ROM 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4" />Abo mvuga ni Abisirayeli: Imana yarabemeye nk’abana bayo, ibahishurira ubwiza bwayo, igirana amasezerano na bo, ibaha n’ivyagezwe vyayo. Yabahaye kandi ibakwe ryo kuyisenga ibaha n’amasezerano yayo. <verse eid="ROM 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5" />Ba sekuruza babo ni Abaheburayo ba rurangiranwa; mu buryo bw’umubiri, Yesu Kristo ubwiwe akomoka muri ubwo bwoko kandi uwo ni we Mana iri hejuru ya vyose, akwiye gushimwa ibihe vyose. Amen.<verse eid="ROM 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uguhitamwo kw’Imana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6" />Ivyo ntibisigura ko ivyo Imana yasezeraniye Abisirayeli vyabaye impfagusa. Haba na mba! Kuko abavukiye mw’ihanga rya Isirayeli bose si Abisirayeli. <verse eid="ROM 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7" />Kandi abakomoka kuri Aburahamu bose, ntibaca baba uruvyaro rwiwe nyakuri. Kuko Ivyanditswe Vyera bivuga ngo: “Uruvyaro nagusezeraniye uzoruronka biciye muri Isaka.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 21:12">Itanguriro 21:12</ref></char></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8" />Ibi bisigura ko abavutse mu buryo bw’umubiri kuri Aburahamu atari bo bana b’Imana, ahubwo abavutse mu buryo bw’isezerano ni bo bana ba Aburahamu b’ukuri. <verse eid="ROM 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9" />Imana ni yo yatanze isezerano iravuga iti: “Umwaka ugeze aha uwu ugeze, nzogaruka kandi Sara azoba afise umwana w’umuhungu.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 18:10">Itanguriro 18:10</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 18:14">14</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="ROM 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10" />Uwo mwana ni sogokuruza wacu Isaka. Igihe yarongora Rebeka yamuvyayeko abana babiri b’amahasa. <verse eid="ROM 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11" />Ariko imbere y’uko bavuka, batarakora ikibi canke iciza, aronka ijambo rivuye ku Mana. Iryo jambo ryavuga ko Imana itoranya abantu ikurikije intumbero yayo, itaravye ibikorwa vyabo. <verse eid="ROM 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 9:12" />Yamubwiye iti: “Bukuru azokorera butoyi.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 25:23">Itanguriro 25:23</ref></char></char></note> Ivyo yabivuze imbere y’uko bavuka; <verse eid="ROM 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:13" />nk’uko Ivyanditswe Vyera bivuga ngo: “Nakunze Yakobo, Esawu we ndamwanka.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAL 1:2">Malaki 1:2</ref>,<ref loc="MAL 1:3">3</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="ROM 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14" />None ivyo bivuga ko Imana irenganya? Haba na mba! <verse eid="ROM 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15" />Kuko Imana yabariye Mose iti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:15">“Nzogirira imbabazi uwo nzohitamwo kuzigirira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:15">kandi nzogirira impuhwe uwo nzohitamwo kuzigirira.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 33:19">Kuvayo 33:19</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="ROM 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16" />Nuko rero, ni Imana ihitamwo uwo igirira imbabazi. Ntidushobora kubihitamwo canke ngo tubikorere. <verse eid="ROM 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17" />Kuko Ivyanditswe Vyera biravuga kuri Farawo, umwami wa Egiputa ngo: “Naguhisemwo kugira ngo nerekanire kuri wewe ubushobozi bwanje kandi kugira ngo izina ryanje rimenyekane kw’isi yose.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 9:16">Kuvayo 9:16</ref></char></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18" />Nuko rero, Imana ihitamwo kwerekana imbabazi zayo ku bo igomba kuzerekanirako, kandi igahitamwo gukomantaza imitima y’abo igomvye.<verse eid="ROM 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19" />Urashobora kuvuga uti: “Nimba ibintu bimeze gutyo, ni kuki Imana ivuga ko abantu batayumvira? Mbega ni nde ashobora kwanka ugushaka kwayo?” <verse eid="ROM 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20" />Ariko none uri nde wewe ngo uharirize Imana? Mbega ikibumbano cobwira uwakibumvye kiti: “Ni kuki wambumvye gutya?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 29:16">Yesaya 29:16</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 45:9">45:9</ref></char></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21" />Mbega umubumvyi ntafise uburenganzira bwo kubumba mw’ibumba rimwe inkono ishobora gukoreshwa ivy’iteka, n’iyindi igenewe ibikorwa bisanzwe?<verse eid="ROM 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22" />N’Imana na yo, naho ifise uburenganzira bwo kwerekana uburake n’ubushobozi bwayo, irihanganira cane abantu bategerezwa kurandurwa n’uburake bwayo. <verse eid="ROM 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23" />Ivyo ibikora kugira ngo ubutunzi bw’ubwiza bwayo burushirize gukayanganira abo yerekanirako imbabazi zayo, bateguriwe ubwo bwiza kuva kera. <verse eid="ROM 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:24" />Kandi natwe turi muri abo yatoranije, bamwe ibakuye mu Bayuda abandi ibakuye mu Banyamahanga. <verse eid="ROM 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25" />Imana yaravugishije Hoseya ku vyerekeye abanyamahanga iti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">“Abantu batahora ari abantu banje, nzobita abantu banje;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:25">kandi abo ntahora nkunda, nzobakunda”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="HOS 2:23">Hoseya 2:23</ref></char></char></note>;<verse eid="ROM 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26" />mbere,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:26">“Mu kibanza babwiriwemwo ngo:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:26">‘Ntimuri abantu banje,’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="HOS 1:10">Hoseya 1:10</ref></char></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:26">ni ho bazobwirirwa ngo: ‘Muri abana b’Imana nzima.’ ”<verse eid="ROM 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27" />Ku vyerekeye Isirayeli, Yesaya yarasemereye avuga ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:27">“Naho Abisirayeli ari benshi bangana n’umusenyi wo ku kiyaga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:27">bakeya gusa ni bo bazorokoka.<verse eid="ROM 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28" />Kuko Uhoraho azoshitsa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:28">kuri iyi si ivyo yavuze avyuzuze rwose kandi ningoga.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 10:22">Yesaya 10:22</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 10:23">23</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="ROM 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29" />Kandi ivyo Yesaya yari yarabivugishijwe imbere y’aho ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:29">“Iyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:29">atadusigariza abadukomokako bakeya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:29">tuba twararanduwe nk’ab’i Sodomu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:29">tuba twaraherengetejwe nk’ab’i Gomora.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 1:9">Yesaya 1:9</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="ROM 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukutizera kw’Abisirayeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30" />Mbega ivyo bisigura iki? Bivuga ko Abanyamahanga batigeze barondera ukugororoka, bakuronse baguhawe n’ukwizera. <verse eid="ROM 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31" />Ariko Abisirayeli bagerageje cane kwemerwa n’Imana mu gukurikiza ivyagezwe, ntibigeze babishikako. <verse eid="ROM 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32" />Ni kuki bitashoboka? Kuko baguma barondera kwemerwa n’Imana mu kugerageza kwumvira ivyagezwe aho kwizera Imana. Uko ni ko batsitaye kuri rya buye ritsitaza, <verse eid="ROM 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33" />iryo Ivyanditswe Vyera bivugako ngo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">“Ehe ndashira i Siyoni ibuye ritsitaza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">n’urutare rugwisha.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">Ariko uwumwizera ntazokwigera amaramara.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 8:14">Yesaya 8:14</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 28:16">28:16</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="ROM 9:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1" />Bene Data, ico umutima wanje wipfuza cane kandi nsaba Imana, ni uko Abisirayeli bose bokizwa. <verse eid="ROM 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2" />Ndashobora gushinga intahe y’uko bafise ishaka ryinshi mu vy’Imana, ariko iryo shaka ryabo ntirihagaze ku bumenyi nyakuri. <verse eid="ROM 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3" />Kuko batatahuye inzira ituma abantu bemerwa n’Imana nk’abagororotsi, bakanka no kwisunga iyo nzira, maze baciye bicira inzira yabo yo kwemerwa n’Imana mu kugerageza kwubahiriza ivyagezwe. <verse eid="ROM 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4" />Mu vy’ukuri Kristo yashikije intumbero ivyagezwe vyari vyarashiriweho. Ni co gituma umuntu wese amwizeye aca yemerwa n’Imana nk’umugororotsi.<verse eid="ROM 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5" />Kuko Mose yanditse avuga ati: “Umuntu ashaka kwemerwa n’Imana nk’umugororotsi yisunze ivyagezwe, azobeshwaho na vyo.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 18:5">Abalewi 18:5</ref></char></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6" />Ariko ukwemerwa n’Imana nk’umugororotsi biciye mu nzira yo kwizera kuvuga kuti: “Ntukibaze mu mutima ngo mbega ni nde azoduga mw’ijuru?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 30:12">Gusubiramwo 30:12</ref></char></char></note> (bisigura, kuzana Kristo kw’isi) <verse eid="ROM 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:7" />canke ngo: “Ni nde azomanuka i kuzimu iyo abapfuye bari?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 30:13">Gusubiramwo 30:13</ref></char></char></note> (bisigura: kuzura Kristo mu bapfuye). <verse eid="ROM 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8" />Kuko Ivyanditswe Vyera bivuga biti: “Ijambo riri hafi yawe; mbere riri mu kanwa kawe no mu mutima wawe.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 30:14">Gusubiramwo 30:14</ref></char></char></note> Iryo jambo ni bwo Butumwa bwo kwizera tuvuga. <verse eid="ROM 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9" />Niwaturisha akanwa kawe ko Yesu ari Umwami, ukizera mu mutima wawe ko Imana yamuzuye mu bapfuye, uzokizwa. <verse eid="ROM 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10" />Kuko umuntu yizeye mu mutima aca yemerwa n’Imana nk’umugororotsi, kandi iyo yatuye n’akanwa kiwe bituma akizwa. <verse eid="ROM 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11" />Ivyanditswe Vyera bivuga biti: “Umuntu wese amwizera ntazokwigera amaramara.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 28:16">Yesaya 28:16</ref></char></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12" />Kandi kuri ivyo, nta tandukaniro riri hagati y’Abayuda n’abanyamahanga, kuko bose bafise Umwami umwe kandi atanga cane agahaza ivyiza uwumwambaje wese. <verse eid="ROM 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13" />Kuko “Umuntu wese azokwambaza izina ry’Uhoraho azokizwa.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="JOL 2:32">Yoweli 2:32</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="ROM 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14" />None abantu bokwambaza bate uwo batarizera? Kandi bomwizera bate batarumva ivyiwe? Canke bokwumva ivyiwe bate ata wubibabwiye? <verse eid="ROM 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15" />Mbega hoho abantu bovuga ivyiwe bate ata wabatumye? Ni co gituma Ivyanditswe Vyera bivuga ngo: “Ese ukuntu ibirenge vy’abazanye Ubutumwa Bwiza ari vyiza!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 52:7">Yesaya 52:7</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="ROM 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16" />Ariko rero si abantu bose bemera kwakira Ubutumwa Bwiza, kuko Yesaya yavugishijwe ngo: “Mwami ni nde yizeye Ubutumwa Bwiza twavuze?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 53:1">Yesaya 53:1</ref></char></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17" />Mu vy’ukuri ukwizera kuzanwa no kwumva Ubutumwa Bwiza, ari ryo jambo rya Kristo. <verse eid="ROM 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18" />Ubu rero ndabaza: mbega none Abayuda iryo jambo nta ryo bumvise? Egome cane bararyumvise! Kuko Ivyanditswe Vyera bivuga ngo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:18">“Ijwi ryumvikanye mw’isi yose;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:18">kandi ivyavuzwe vyashitse ku mpera z’isi.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 19:4">Zaburi 19:4</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="ROM 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19" />Nkongera nkabaza nti: Mbega Abisirayeli ntibigeze baritahura? Egome cane bararitahuye, kuko Mose ari we yabanje kuvuga ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:19">“Nzobateza kwipfuza ivy’abantu batari babereye no kwitwa ihanga;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:19">ndabateze kugirira ishari ihanga ritagira n’ugutahura.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 32:21">Gusubiramwo 32:21</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="ROM 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20" />Mu nyuma, Yesaya na we yavuze ashize amanga ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:20">“Nabonywe n’abatariko baranandondera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:20">niyereka abatariko baranabaza ivyanje.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 65:1">Yesaya 65:1</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="ROM 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21" />Ariko ku vyerekeye Isirayeli, Imana yaravuze iti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:21">“Umusi wose niriwe nshanje amaboko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:21">ndayategeye ubwoko butumvira kandi bw’intagondwa.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 65:2">Yesaya 65:2</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="ROM 10:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11" />
  <para style="s1">Imana ntiyahevye Abisirayeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1" />Ndongera nkabaza nti: Mbega Imana yoba yarahevye abantu bayo ari bo Bisirayeli? Haba na mba! Jewe ubwanje ndi Umwisirayeli, uruvyaro rwa Aburahamu, nkaba nkomoka mu muryango wa Benyamini. <verse eid="ROM 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2" />Imana ntiyahevye abantu bayo yatoranije kuva kera. Mbega murazi ico Ivyanditswe Vyera bivuga kuri ivyo? Uwavugishwa n’Imana Eliya yareze Abisirayeli ku Mana ati: <verse eid="ROM 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:3" />“Uhoraho, bishe abavugishwa bawe, basangangura n’ibicaniro vyawe. Ni jewe jenyene nsigaye kandi nanje bariko barandondera ngo banyice.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 19:10">1 Abami 19:10</ref>,<ref loc="1KI 19:14">14</ref></char></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4" />Mbega inyishu y’Imana yabaye iyihe? Yamubwiye iti: “Naribikiye abantu ibihumbi indwi batigeze bapfukamira ikigirwamana Bayali ngo bagisenge.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 19:18">1 Abami 19:18</ref></char></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5" />No muri kino gihe ni ko bimeze, harasigaye Abisirayeli bakeya bakiri abizigirwa kuko ubuntu bw’Imana bwabazigamye. <verse eid="ROM 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6" />Ivyo vyavuye ku buntu bw’Imana gusa, ntivyavuye ku bikorwa vyiza bakoze. Kuko, iyo biba vyavuye ku bikorwa vyiza bakoze, ubuntu bw’Imana ntibwoba bukibaye ubuntu vy’ukuri.<verse eid="ROM 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7" />Mbega ivyo bisigura iki? Bivuga ko benshi mu Bisirayeli bataronse kwemerwa n’Imana naho babironderana ishaka ryinshi. Ni abantu bakeya gusa batoranijwe n’Imana babironse, ariko imitima y’abandi yashishikaye gukomantara, <verse eid="ROM 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8" />nk’uko Ivyanditswe Vyera bivuga ngo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:8">“Imana yabahinduye ibiyingiyingi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:8">bafise amaso ariko ntibabona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:8">bafise amatwi ariko ntibumva,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:8">gushika n’uno musi.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 29:4">Gusubiramwo 29:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 29:10">Yesaya 29:10</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="ROM 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9" />Dawidi na we yavuze, ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:9">“Reka indya zo ku meza yabo zibabere umutego n’ikinogo co kugwamwo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:9">ibuye ritsitaza n’ingero bakwiranye.<verse eid="ROM 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10" />Reka amaso yabo ahume ntibashobore kubona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:10">n’imigongo yabo yame ihetamye ibihe vyose!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 69:22">Zaburi 69:22</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 69:23">23</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="ROM 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukwemerwa kw’abanyamahanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11" />Nuko rero ndabaza: None abantu b’Imana baratsitaye bagwa ubutakivyuka? Haba na mba! Ariko kugwa kwabo kwatumye agakiza gashikira Abanyamahanga, kugira ngo bibatere kugira ishari, maze bipfuze ako gakiza na bo. <verse eid="ROM 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12" />Nimba kutumvira kwabo kwatungishije isi kandi nimba Abanyamahanga bahawe umugisha n’uko Abisirayeli banse agakiza, iyumvire ingene isi izohezagirwa igihe bazohindukirira Imana n’imitima yabo yose.<verse eid="ROM 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13" />Ni mwebwe Banyamahanga ndiko ndabwira kuko Imana yampamagariye kuba intumwa mu Banyamahanga. Ico gikorwa ndakinezererewe, <verse eid="ROM 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14" />kugira ngo ntume Abisirayeli bagirira ishari ico mwebwe abanyamahanga mufise, bikunze ndokore bamwe muri bo. <verse eid="ROM 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15" />Kuko nimba kwigizwayo kwabo kwazaniye agakiza abo kw’isi bose, mbega kwemerwa kwabo ntikuzozana ivyiza birushirije? Bizomera nko gusubiza ubuzima abari barapfuye! <verse eid="ROM 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16" />Nimba ikimanyu c’umukate cashikaniwe Imana nk’ivyeze ubwa mbere cejejwe, umukate wose uba wejejwe; kandi nimba imizi y’igiti yejejwe, n’amashami na yo nyene aba yejejwe.<verse eid="ROM 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17" />Mwebwe abanyamahanga, mugereranywa n’amashami y’igiti c’umwelayo wo mw’ishamba, yatewe ku giti c’umwelayo wo mu murima. Mwasubiriye amwe mu mashami yaco yaciwe, muca musangira n’ayasigaye ingaburo iva mu mizi y’uwo mwelayo w’umurimano. <verse eid="ROM 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18" />Nuko rero, ntimukishime kuri ayo mashami yaciwe, kuko mwebwe muri amashami gusa, ntimuri imizi. Imizi ni yo ibashigikiye. <verse eid="ROM 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19" />Ariko urashobora kuvuga uti: “Erega ayo mashami y’ukuri yaciwe kugira ngo nterwe mu kibanza cayo.” <verse eid="ROM 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20" />Ukwo ni ukuri. Ariko wibuke ko ayo mashami yaciwe kubera ukutizera, kandi nawe uhagumijwe n’ukwizera. Rero, ntiwishime ahubwo utinye. <verse eid="ROM 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21" />Kuko nimba Imana itihanganiye Abayuda bagereranywa n’amashami y’ukuri, na wewe yohava itakwihanganira.<verse eid="ROM 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22" />Raba rero ingene Imana igira neza, ariko kandi igahambara: yahambariye abaguye, ariko wewe ikugirira ubuntu, nimba ushishikara kugendera muri ukwo kugira neza kwayo. Bitari ukwo, na wewe uzocibwa nta kabuza. <verse eid="ROM 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23" />Kandi Abisirayeli nibemera guhindukira bakava mu kutizera kwabo, bazosubira baterwe ku giti bahozeko, kuko Imana irashoboye kubikora. <verse eid="ROM 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24" />Mu vy’ukuri, wewe muri kamere muntu kawe umeze nk’ishami ry’umwelayo wo mw’ishamba. Nimba rero Imana yakoze ikintu kinyuranye n’uko ibintu bisanzwe bimeze, ikemera kugutera ku mwelayo wo mu murima, bizoyorohera cane gusubiza amashami y’ukuri aho yahoze?<verse eid="ROM 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abisirayeli bose bazokizwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25" />Bene Data, ndagomba ko mumenya iri banga ngira ndababwire kugira ngo bibarinde ubwibone. Bamwe mu Bisirayeli bafise imitima ikomantaye, ariko ivyo bizorangira igitigiri c’Abanyamahanga binjira mu gakiza gikwiye. <verse eid="ROM 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26" />Ico gihe, Abisirayeli bose bazokizwa, nk’uko handitswe ngo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:26">“Umurokozi azova i Siyoni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:26">kandi azohindura aba Yakobo abakure mu kutubaha Imana.<verse eid="ROM 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27" />Iri ni ryo sezerano nzobashitsako</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:27">ninabakurako ibicumuro vyabo.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 59:20">Yesaya 59:20</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 59:21">21</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 27:9">27:9</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:33">Yeremiya 31:33</ref>,<ref loc="JER 31:34">34</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="ROM 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28" />Benshi mu Bisirayeli ubu ni abansi b’Ubutumwa Bwiza, kandi ivyo bizanira inyungu mwebwe abanyamahanga. Ariko, ku bijanye no gutoranywa, iracabakunda kubera ba Sekuruza babo Aburahamu, Isaka na Yakobo. <verse eid="ROM 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29" />Kuko Imana idasubira ku ngabire yatanze canke ngo ihebe abo yatoranije, <verse eid="ROM 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30" />nk’uko namwe abanyamahanga mwigeze kuba mu mugararizo, mutumvira Imana, ariko ubu mukaba mwaragiriwe imbabazi kubera Abisirayeli bagararije. <verse eid="ROM 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31" />Babaye abagarariji, kugira ngo nk’uko namwe mwagiriwe imbabazi, na bo baze bazigirirwe. <verse eid="ROM 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32" />Kuko abantu bose baragararije Imana, bituma ibafata nk’imbohe. Ivyo ibikora kugira ngo ibagirire imbabazi bose.<verse eid="ROM 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawulo atangarira Imana</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33" />Mbega ubwinshi bw’ubwenge n’ubumenyi vy’Imana!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:33">Ingingo ifata ntizitahurika</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:33">kandi inzira zayo ntizimenyekana.<verse eid="ROM 11:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34" />“Ni nde yigeze amenya ivyiyumviro vy’Uhoraho?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:34">Canke ni nde yayibereye umujenama?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 40:13">Yesaya 40:13</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="ROM 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35" />“Hari uwoba yarigeze kugurana Imana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:35">kugira ngo ize imwishure?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="JOB 41:11">Yobu 41:11</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="ROM 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36" />Vyose ni yo ibitanga, bibeshejweho n’ubushobozi bwayo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:36">kandi biriho kugira ngo biyiheshe icubahiro.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:36">Icubahiro cose kibe icayo ibihe vyose! Amen.<verse eid="ROM 11:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12" />
  <para style="s1">Ibimazi bifise ubugingo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1" />None rero bene Data, kubera izo mbabazi nyinshi Imana yatugiriye, ndabinginga ngo mushikanire Imana imibiri yanyu nk’ibimazi bifise ubugingo, vyejejwe kandi biyihimbara. Uko ni ko kuyisenga kwanyu kwoyihimbara. <verse eid="ROM 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2" />Ntimukigane inyifato n’imigenzo vy’isi ya kino gihe, ariko mureke Imana ibahindure rwose mu kubaha ukwiyumvira gushasha. Aho ni ho muzoshobora gutahura ivyo Imana ibagombako, kuko ni vyo vyiza, ni vyo biyihimbara kandi ni vyo bitunganye rwose.<verse eid="ROM 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uko bikwiye kumera mu mubiri wa Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3" />Nisunze ubuntu nahawe n’Imana, ndahanuye umuntu wese muri mwebwe ngo ntiyifate uko atari mu kwiyumvira ko ari uwuhambaye, ariko yicishe bugufi mu kwifata uko ari, yisunze urugero rwo kwizera Imana yamuhaye. <verse eid="ROM 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4" />Nk’uko iyi mibiri yacu ifise ibihimba bitandukanye kandi ivyo bihimba bigakora ibikorwa bitandukanye, <verse eid="ROM 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:5" />ni ko no mu mubiri wa Kristo bimeze: turi ibihimba vyinshi bigize umubiri umwe, kandi kuri wo, twese tuba dufatanye. <verse eid="ROM 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6" />Dufise ingabire zitandukanye, bivanye n’ubuntu Imana yatugiriye. Nimba ufise ingabire yo kuvugishwa n’Imana, ubikore ukurikije ukwizera wahawe. <verse eid="ROM 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7" />Nimba ingabire yawe ari ugufasha abandi, ubikore neza. Nimba ingabire yawe ari ukwigisha, igisha neza. <verse eid="ROM 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8" />Nimba wahawe ingabire yo gutera intege abandi, ube uwutera intege koko. Nimba wahawe ingabire yo gutanga, tangana umutima ubikunze. Nimba wahawe kurongora abandi, ubikorane umwete. Nimba wahawe ingabire yo kugira impuhwe, uzigire unezerewe.<verse eid="ROM 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ingene ubuzima bw’umukristo bukwiye kumera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9" />Urukundo rwanyu ntirube urw’agahemo. Mwanke ibibi, mufatane n’ivyiza. <verse eid="ROM 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10" />Urukundo rwanyu rurangwe no kugiriranira igishika nk’abavukana, kandi umuntu wese anezerezwe no gushira imbere mugenziwe. <verse eid="ROM 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11" />Ntimukabe abanebwe, ahubwo mwamane umwete mu mitima yanyu wo gukorera Umwami Imana. <verse eid="ROM 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12" />Ivyizigiro vyanyu bitume mugumana umunezero. Mwihanganire imibabaro kandi mushishikare gusenga. <verse eid="ROM 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13" />Mufashe bene Data mu vyo bakenye kandi mwakirane hagati yanyu.<verse eid="ROM 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14" />Muhezagire ababagirira nabi, ntimubavume ahubwo mubahezagire. <verse eid="ROM 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15" />Abanezerewe, munezeranwe na bo, abarira murirane na bo. <verse eid="ROM 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16" />Mubane amahoro n’abandi. Ntimukishire hejuru, ahubwo munezerezwe no kwifatanya n’abaciye bugufi. Ntimukiyite abanyabwenge.<verse eid="ROM 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17" />Ntimukishure inabi uwayibagiriye. Ahubwo mwitwararike gukora ivyiza mu maso y’abantu bose. <verse eid="ROM 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18" />Nimba bishoboka, igihe cose vyoba biva kuri mwebwe, mubane amahoro n’abantu bose. <verse eid="ROM 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19" />Abo nkunda, ntimukihore uwubagiriye nabi, ariko mubirekere uburake bw’Imana, kuko handitswe ngo: “Uguhora ni ukwanje, ni jewe nzokwishura umuntu ibikwiranye n’ivyo yakoze.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 32:35">Gusubiramwo 32:35</ref></char></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20" />Ikigeretseko:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 12:20">“Umwansi wawe niyasonza, uramugaburira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 12:20">niyanyoterwa umuhe ico kunywa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 12:20">Niwakora uko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 12:20">uzoba umusutse amakara yaka ku mutwe.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PRO 25:21">Imigani 25:21</ref>,<ref loc="PRO 25:22">22</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="ROM 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21" />Ikibi ntikikakuneshe ngo abe ari co ukora, ariko ukinesheshe gukora iciza.<verse eid="ROM 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13" />
  <para style="s1">Kwubaha abategetsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1" />Umuntu wese akwiye kwubaha abategetsi, kuko ata butegetsi na bumwe bubaho Imana itabushizeho. Ubutegetsi buriho bwashizweho n’Imana. <verse eid="ROM 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2" />Ni co gituma, umuntu wese agarariza ubutegetsi, aba agararije urutonde rw’Imana, kandi uwukoze ivyo aba yikwegeye gutsindwa n’urubanza. <verse eid="ROM 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3" />Kuko abatware ntibateye ubwoba ku bakora ibibereye, ahubwo bateye ubwoba ku bakora ibibi. Woba ugomba kutagira ubwoba imbere y’abategetsi? Kora ibibereye bazogushimira. <verse eid="ROM 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4" />Kuko abategetsi ni abakozi batumwe n’Imana ku neza yawe. Ariko nimba ukora ibibi, birumvikana ko utegerezwa gutinya, kuko bafise ububasha bwo kuguhana. Ni abakozi Imana yatumye guhana inkozi z’ibibi. <verse eid="ROM 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5" />Ni co gituma ubwirizwa kubumvira, atari mu ntumbero yo kugira ngo ntuhanwe, ariko kandi kubera ijwi ryo mu mutima ribidutegeka.<verse eid="ROM 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6" />Ni co gituma ukwiye gutanga ikori neza, kuko abategetsi baba bariko barakorera Imana iyo barangura igikorwa cabo co gutegeka. <verse eid="ROM 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7" />Uhe umuntu wese ivyo akwiye guhabwa: abakwiye guhabwa amakori mubahe amakori, uwukwiye gutinywa mumutinye, uwukwiye icubahiro mumwubahe.<verse eid="ROM 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dukundane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8" />Ntihagire umwenda mugirira umuntu n’umwe, kiretse uwo gukundana, kuko uwukunda abandi, aba ashikije ivyagezwe. <verse eid="ROM 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9" />Amabwirizwa avuga ngo: “Ntugasambane; ntukice; ntukibe; ntukipfuze ivy’abandi,”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 20:13-15">Kuvayo 20:13-15</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 20:17">17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:17-19">Gusubiramwo 5:17-19</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 5:21">21</ref></char></char></note> hamwe n’ayandi nk’ayo akoranirijwe muri iri rimwe rivuga ngo: “Ukunde mugenzawe nk’uko wikunda.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Abalewi 19:18</ref></char></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:10" />Uwukunda nta kibi na kimwe yogirira uwo akunda. Uwukunda, aba ashikije ivyagezwe vyose.<verse eid="ROM 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwitegurira kugaruka kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11" />Kandi ivyo mukwiye kubishishikara kuko muzi igihe tugezemwo. Iki ni igihe co kwikangura, kuko agakiza kacu katwegereye kurusha ca gihe twatangura kwizera. <verse eid="ROM 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12" />Ijoro riritereye, igitondo c’agakiza kiri hafi gushika. Kubera ivyo, twiyambure ibikorwa vy’umwijima, twambare ibigwanisho vy’umuco aribwo buzima bugororotse. <verse eid="ROM 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:13" />Twigenze neza nk’abagenda ku murango. Twirinde kurenza urugero mu vyokurya no mu vyo kunywa. Twirinde ubusambanyi no kugendera mu biteye isoni. Twirinde gutongana no kugiriranira ishari. <verse eid="ROM 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14" />Ahubwo, murondere gusa n’Umwami Yesu Kristo nk’aho ari we mwambaye, aho kwitaho imibiri yanyu ngo mushitse ivyo yipfuza.<verse eid="ROM 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14" />
  <para style="s1">Ntugacire imanza abandi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1" />Mwakire mwene Data wundi atarakomera mu kwizera, ntimumucire urubanza ku vyo atarasobanukirwa neza. <verse eid="ROM 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2" />Nk’akarorero, uwukomeye mu kwizera ashobora kurya indya zose. Uwundi na we, kubera atarakomera mu kwizera, agahitamwo kurya imboga gusa. <verse eid="ROM 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3" />Uwushobora kurya indya zose, ntakwiye gukengera uwutarya zose, kandi uwutarya indya zose, ntakwiye gukengera uwurya zose, kuko na we nyene Imana yaramwakiriye. <verse eid="ROM 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4" />Uri nde wewe ucira imanza umukozi w’uwundi muntu? Akoze neza canke nabi, ivyo biraba shebuja. Kandi noneho azokora neza kuko Umwami Imana afise ubushobozi bwo kumukomeza.<verse eid="ROM 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5" />No ku vyerekeye imisi, hari uwiyumvira ko hari umusi wejejwe kuruta iyindi, uwundi akiyumvira ko yose ingana ku bijanye no gusenga Imana. Umuntu wese akwiye kumenya neza ivyo yizera ku giti ciwe. <verse eid="ROM 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6" />Uwubahiriza umusi kanaka abikora ahesha icubahiro Imana. Uwurya indya zose abikora ahesha icubahiro Imana, kuko abikora ayishimira. N’uwirinda kurya bimwebimwe na we nyene abikora ahesha icubahiro Imana kandi abiyishimira. <verse eid="ROM 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7" />Erega nta muntu n’umwe muri twebwe abaho canke apfa ku bwiwe. <verse eid="ROM 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:8" />Nimba turiho, tubayeho kugira ngo duheshe icubahiro Umwami Imana. Kandi nimba dupfuye, dupfa kugira ngo duheshe icubahiro Umwami Imana. Nuko rero turiho canke dupfuye, tuguma turi ab’Umwami Imana. <verse eid="ROM 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9" />Kuko icatumye Kristo apfa akazuka ni ukugira ngo abe umwami w’abazima n’abapfuye.<verse eid="ROM 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10" />None wewe ni kuki ucira imanza mwene Data wundi? Canke ni kuki umukengera? Wibuke ko twese tuzohagarara imbere y’intebe y’imanza y’Imana. <verse eid="ROM 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11" />Ivyanditswe Vyera bivuga biti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">“ ‘Ndahiye ukubaho kwanje,’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 45:23">Yesaya 45:23</ref></char></char></note> ni ko Uhoraho avuze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">‘amavi yose azompfukamira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 14:11">n’indimi zose zizokwatura ko ndi Imana.’ ”<verse eid="ROM 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12" />Nuko rero, umuntu wese muri twebwe azokwisigura imbere y’Imana ku bijanye n’ubuzima bwiwe kw’isi.<verse eid="ROM 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13" />Twirinde rero guciranira imanza. Ahubwo, twigire inama yo kutagira ikintu na kimwe dukora cotsitaza canke kikagwisha mu caha mwene Data wundi. <verse eid="ROM 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14" />Ndazi neza ntakekeranya, nemejwe n’Umwami Yesu, ko ata kintu na kimwe gihumanye ubwaco. Ariko nimba hariho umuntu yiyumvira ko ikintu kanaka gihumanye, ico kintu gicika igihumanye kuri we. <verse eid="ROM 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15" />Iyo ivyo urya bitsitaza mwene Data wundi, hanyuma ugashishikara ubirya, ntuba ukiriko uragendera mu rukundo. Ntukemere rero ko indya urya zituma uwo Kristo yapfiriye akora icaha akaranduka. <verse eid="ROM 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16" />Wirinde kugira ngo ico ukoze ubona ko ari ciza coye gutukwa n’abantu. <verse eid="ROM 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17" />Kuko igihambaye mu Bwami bw’Imana si ukurya no kunywa, ahubwo ni ubuzima bugororotse, amahoro n’umunezero bitangwa na Mpwemu Yera. <verse eid="ROM 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18" />Iyo umuntu akorera Kristo ameze gutyo, ahimbara Imana kandi akemerwa n’abantu.<verse eid="ROM 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19" />None rero, muze turonderane umwete kubana amahoro no gukomezanya hagati yacu. <verse eid="ROM 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20" />Ntugasambure igikorwa c’Imana kubera ivyokurya. Mu vy’ukuri, nta co kurya na kimwe gihumanye, ariko ni bibi kurya indya zituma mwene Data wundi agwa mu caha. <verse eid="ROM 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21" />Ni vyiza kutarya inyama canke kutanywa umuvinyu canke kudakora ikindi kintu na kimwe cotuma mwene Data wundi agwa mu caha.<verse eid="ROM 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22" />Ico wizera kuri ivyo kibe hagati yawe n’Imana gusa. Hahiriwe umuntu akora ikintu yumva ko ari ic’ukuri ata jwi rimwagiriza mu mutima. <verse eid="ROM 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23" />Ariko iyo umuntu agikekeranya ku bijanye no kurya canke kureka kurya ikintu kanaka, iyo abirenzeko akakirya, aba yihamagariye gutsindwa n’urubanza, kuko ataba yemezwa neza ko ivyo ari vyo yari akwiye gukora. Ikintu cose umuntu akora kitavuye ku kwizera kimubera icaha.<verse eid="ROM 14:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1" />Twebwe abakomeye mu kwizera dukwiye kwihanganira abadakomeye mu kwizera, ntiturondere ibitunezereza gusa. <verse eid="ROM 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2" />Dukwiye gufasha bagenzi bacu gukora ibibereye mu ntumbero yo kubafasha gukura mu kwizera. <verse eid="ROM 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3" />Na Kristo ubwiwe ntiyabayeho arondera kwinezereza. Ahubwo, Ivyanditswe Vyera bivuga biti: “Ibitutsi abantu bagututse, vyose vyashikiye kuri jewe.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 69:9">Zaburi 69:9</ref></char></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4" />Kuko ivyanditswe kera vyose vyanditswe kugira ngo bitwigishe. Bidushoboza kwihangana, bikadutera n’intege kugira ngo dushobore kwizigira ko Imana izoshitsa ivyo yasezeranye.<verse eid="ROM 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5" />Imana, yo iduha kwihangana ikadutera intege, ibahe guhuza umutima n’inama nk’uko bibereye abakurikira Kristo Yesu, <verse eid="ROM 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:6" />kugira ngo mwese hamwe muhimbaze Imana Se w’Umwami wacu Yesu Kristo n’umutima umwe n’ijwi rimwe.<verse eid="ROM 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7" />Nk’uko Kristo yabakiriye, namwe abe ari ko mwakirana kugira ngo biheshe Imana icubahiro. <verse eid="ROM 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8" />Mwibuke ko Kristo yaje ari uwukorera Abayuda kugira ngo abereke ko Imana ari umwizigirwa ku masezerano yasezeraniye ba sekuruza. <verse eid="ROM 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9" />Vyongeye, yazanywe no kugira ngo n’Abanyamahanga na bo bahabwe akaryo ko guhimbaza Imana kubera imbabazi zayo, nk’uko Ivyanditswe Vyera bivuga ngo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:9">“Ni co gituma nzogutazira mu Banyamahanga;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:9">nzotazira izina ryawe mu ndirimbo.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="2SA 22:50">2 Samweli 22:50</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 18:49">Zaburi 18:49</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="ROM 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10" />Ivyanditswe birabandanya bikavuga ngo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:10">“Yemwe Banyamahanga, nimunezeranwe n’ubwoko bwayo.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 32:43">Gusubiramwo 32:43</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="ROM 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11" />Ahandi na ho bikavuga biti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:11">“Nimutazire Uhoraho, yemwe Banyamahanga mwese,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:11">namwe mahanga, nimumushire hejuru.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 117:1">Zaburi 117:1</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="ROM 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12" />Ahandi na ho Yesaya yavugishijwe ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">“Uwukomoka kuri Isayi azoza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:12">azohaguruka kugira ngo aganze amahanga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">muri we ni ho Abanyamahanga bose</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:12">bazoshira ivyizigiro.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 11:10">Yesaya 11:10</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="ROM 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13" />Imana, yo itanga ivyizigiro, ibuzuze umunezero n’amahoro kuko muyizera, kugira ngo murushirize kwizigira amasezerano yayo mubishobojwe na Mpwemu Yera.<verse eid="ROM 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawulo intumwa mu Banyamahanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14" />Bene Data, jewe ubwanje ndazi neza ntakekeranya ko mwuzuye ineza n’ubumenyi bwose kandi ko mushoboye kwigishanya. <verse eid="ROM 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15" />Ariko ndabandikiye kuri bimwebimwe nshize amanga nk’uwubibutsa kubera ubuntu Imana yangiriye <verse eid="ROM 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:16" />bwo kuba intumwa ya Kristo Yesu mu Banyamahanga. Ndababwira Ubutumwa Bwiza kugira ngo ndabashikanire Imana nk’ikimazi cemerwa na yo, cejejwe na Mpwemu Yera.<verse eid="ROM 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17" />Ndafise rero imvo zituma nezerererwa igikorwa nkorera Imana muri Kristo Yesu. <verse eid="ROM 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18" />Yamara rero nta kintu mfise nokwirata kiretse ico Kristo yankoresheje mu majambo no mu bikorwa, kugira ngo nshikane Abanyamahanga ku kwumvira Imana. <verse eid="ROM 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:19" />Abo bemejwe n’ubushobozi bwagaragariye mu bitangaza n’utwumiza hamwe n’ubushobozi bwa Mpwemu w’Imana. Uko ni ko navuze Ubutumwa Bwiza bwa Kristo kuva i Yerusalemu kugeza nshitse muri Ilurikumu. <verse eid="ROM 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20" />Ico namye nipfuza kwari ukuvuga Ubutumwa Bwiza ahantu izina rya Kristo ritarigera rivugwa, kugira ngo sinubake ku rufatiro rwashizweho n’uwundi muntu. <verse eid="ROM 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21" />Nakoze nisunze iri jambo ryo mu Vyanditswe Vyera rivuga riti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:21">“Abatigeze bumva ivyiwe, bazomubona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:21">kandi abatigeze bamwumva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:21">bazotahura ivyiwe.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 52:15">Yesaya 52:15</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="ROM 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22" />Icatumye nteba kuza iwanyu, ni uko nariko ndavuga Ubutumwa muri izo ntara.<verse eid="ROM 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawulo ategura kuja i Roma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23" />Ubu rero ko nahejeje ibikorwa nahora nkorera muri izo ntara nkaba nari maze iyi myaka yose ndindiriye, ndipfuza cane kubagendera. <verse eid="ROM 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24" />Ndiko ndategura kuja muri Esupanye maze mpite ndabaramutsa. Nitwamarana inkumbu, muzoheza mumfashishe ivya nkenerwa kugira mbandanye urugendo. <verse eid="ROM 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25" />Ariko imbere yo kuza, nzobanza kuja i Yerusalemu gushikiriza bene Data baho imfashanyo. <verse eid="ROM 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:26" />Amashengero y’i Makedoniya no muri Akaya yahimbawe no kwegeraniriza imfashanyo abakene bo mu bizera b’i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="ROM 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27" />Ivyo babikoranye umunezero, ariko mu vy’ukuri bari babafitiye umwenda, kuko Abanyamahanga baronse umugisha wo mu buryo bw’impwemu uvuye ku Butumwa Bwiza bashikirijwe n’abizera b’i Yerusalemu. Ni co gituma na bo bahisemwo kubafashisha ku vy’ubutunzi bwabo. <verse eid="ROM 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28" />Ninaheza ico gikorwa co kubashikiriza iyo mfashanyo, nzoheza mpite ndabaramutsa ngiye muri Esupanye. <verse eid="ROM 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29" />Kandi ndazi neza ko aho nzozira tuzosangira umugisha wa Kristo wuzuye.<verse eid="ROM 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30" />Ariko bene Data, ndabinginga mw’izina ry’Umwami wacu Yesu Kristo no mu rukundo rwa Mpwemu Yera ngo mumfashe kugwana intambara mu masengesho. <verse eid="ROM 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31" />Munsengere kugira ngo Imana ize indinde abatizera b’i Yudaya, kandi n’abizera na bo b’i Yerusalemu baze bemere imfashanyo ndabashiriye. <verse eid="ROM 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32" />Maze, Imana ibishatse, nzoheza nze iwanyu nuzuye umunezero, gutyo nduhurwe no kubana namwe. <verse eid="ROM 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33" />Imana, yo itanga amahoro, ibane namwe mwese. Amen.<verse eid="ROM 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="ROM 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16" />
  <para style="s1">Intasho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1" />Ndafise ivyiza mvuga kuri mwene Data Foyibe, umudiyakonikazi mu rusengero rw’i Kenkireya. <verse eid="ROM 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2" />Ndabasavye muze mumwakire mw’izina ry’Umwami wacu nk’uko bibereye abera b’Imana. Muze mumufashe mu vyo azokenera vyose, kuko yagiriye ikimazi benshi na canecane jewe.<verse eid="ROM 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3" />Muntahirize Pirisila na Akwilasi, abakoranye nanje igikorwa ca Kristo Yesu. <verse eid="ROM 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4" />Ni kenshi bahatswe gupfa bagomba gukiza ubuzima bwanje. Ivyo, si jewe jenyene ndabibashimira, ariko ni amashengero yose y’Abanyamahanga.<verse eid="ROM 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5" />Muntahirize ishengero rikoranira mu nzu yabo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:5">Muntahirize umukunzi wanje Epayineto, uwabaye uwa mbere mu bizeye Yesu Kristo mu ntara ya Aziya.<verse eid="ROM 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6" />Muntahirize Mariya, yitanze cane mu gukorera mwebwe.<verse eid="ROM 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7" />Muntahirize Anduroniko na Yuniya, Abayuda bagenzanje twabanye mw’ibohero. Ni abantu bubashwe cane mu zindi ntumwa kandi barantanze kwizera Kristo.<verse eid="ROM 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8" />Muntahirize Ampuliyato, umukunzi wanje mu Mwami wacu.<verse eid="ROM 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9" />Muntahirize Uribano, uwo dusangiye igikorwa muri Kristo, na Sitakusi nkunda cane.<verse eid="ROM 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10" />Muntahirize Apelesi, umugabo yagaragaje ko ari umwizigirwa kuri Kristo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:10">Kandi muntahirize abo mu nzu kwa Arisitobulo.<verse eid="ROM 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11" />Muntahirize Herodiyoni, Umuyuda mugenzanje.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:11">Muntahirize abo mu nzu kwa Narasisi bizera Umwami Yesu.<verse eid="ROM 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12" />Muntahirize Tirifina na Tirifoza, bitanze cane mu gukorera Umwami.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:12">Muntahirize kandi n’umukunzi wanje Peresi, yitanze cane mu gukorera Umwami.<verse eid="ROM 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13" />Muntahirize Rufusi, yatoranijwe mu Mwami, hamwe na nyina kandi nanje yahavuye ambera mama.<verse eid="ROM 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14" />Muntahirize Asinkirito, Fulegoni, Heremesi, Patorobasi, Herumasi na bene Data bari kumwe na bo.<verse eid="ROM 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15" />Muntahirize Filologo, Yuliya, Nerewusi na mushikiwe, hamwe na Olumpa na bene Data bose bari kumwe na bo.<verse eid="ROM 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16" />Muramukanye mu kugumbirana kwera.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:16">Amashengero yose ya Kristo arabatasha.<verse eid="ROM 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17" />Bene Data, ndabinginga ngo mwirinde ababigisha inyigisho zo kubacanishamwo no kuzimiza abizera zitandukanye n’izo mwigishijwe. Abameze gutyo mubigireyo. <verse eid="ROM 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18" />Kuko abakora ivyo, ntibariko bakorera Umwami wacu Kristo, ahubwo bakorera inyungu zabo gusa. Amajambo yabo yo kuryosharyosha hamwe n’imvugo nziza, ni vyo bahendesha abantu b’imitima yoroshe. <verse eid="ROM 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19" />Ariko abantu bose barazi ko mwumvira Umwami Yesu, kandi ivyo birampimbara cane. Ndagomba ko muba abanyabwenge mu kumenya ivyiza, ariko mu bibi mube nk’abatagira ico bazi.<verse eid="ROM 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20" />Kandi Imana, itanga amahoro izofyonyorera vuba Satani musi y’ibirenge vyanyu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ROM 16:20" />
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:20">Ubuntu bw’Umwami wacu Yesu bubane namwe.<verse eid="ROM 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21" />Timoteyo, uwo dukorana, arabaramutsa, co kimwe na Lukiyo, Yasoni na Sosipateri Abayuda bagenzanje.<verse eid="ROM 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22" />Nanje Terutiyo, nafashije Pawulo kwandika iri kete, ndabaramukije mw’izina rya Yesu.<verse eid="ROM 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23" />Gayo, ampaye indaro hamwe n’ishengero ryose rikoranira iwe barabaramutsa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:23">Erasito, umunyabigega w’igisagara, hamwe na mwene Data Kwarito barabaramutsa.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ROM 16:23" />
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:23">[ <verse eid="ROM 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 16:24" />Ubuntu bw’Umwami wacu Yesu Kristo bubane namwe mwese. Amen.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu nzandiko zimwezimwe za Bibiliya aya majambo ntarimwo.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25" />Imana, yo ishobora kubakomeza mu kwizera, nk’uko Ubutumwa nahawe buvuga ihabwe icubahiro. Ubwo Butumwa buvuga Yesu Kristo kandi bwerekana umugambi Imana ifise kuri mwebwe abanyamahanga, wari waragizwe ibanga kuva kera. <verse eid="ROM 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:26" />Ariko nk’uko abavugishwa n’Imana bari barabivuze kandi nk’uko Imana Ihoraho yari yarabitegetse kuva kera, ubwo butumwa bwarahishuwe kugira ngo abanyamahanga aho bari hose, na bo bashobore kuyizera no kuyumvira. <verse eid="ROM 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27" />Icubahiro cose kibe ic’Imana yo nyene ubwenge bwose, ibihe vyose mw’izina rya Yesu Kristo! Amen.<verse eid="ROM 16:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 16" />
</usx>